{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 45, :comments ["<b>For I am YHWH who brought you up from the land of Egypt to be your Elohim.</b> It is fitting for you to make this effort to become sanctified and holy, in order to attain My will. For indeed My intent when I brought you up from the land of Egypt was so that you would attain this — that I would be your Elohim without intermediary, and that you would be holy and eternal through your likening yourselves to Me in attributes and intelligibles, for I am holy."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:36:05.999877646Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}